// Lesson 3.2a — Projectiles: Instantiate, Fire, Destroy
// Problem breakdown: Spawning, aiming, moving, and cleaning up projectiles.
// Reading Unity functions (Instantiate vs Destroy, Translate vs Rigidbody velocity).
